	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"You've seen them around, haven't you? On the land, in the skies, in the seas. Yes, your eyes do not deceive you. Admist this world are the creatures known as &o&6dragons&r."
				"There's more to learn if you want to truly know these creatures. And I'll tell you what I know if you show interest."
			]
