		{
			dependencies: ["2CDA1B09CD0AAB77"]
			description: [
				"Well, you probably want to get into it, right? In that case, take a look around. Dragons are unique beings, and not all will be tamed so easily. &o&6Some stronger, more agressive dragons will need to be engaged in battle, weakened before any attempt to tame is possible.&r"
				""
				"There are many dragons, but the simplest of them all is the Stegonaut. These beings are no stranger to humans of a different time, &6&oso all one really needs is its favourite meal&r."
			]
