			title: "How to Tame Your Dragon"
			x: -0.5d
			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2D969CC596421CAB"]
			description: [
				"[ \"In your Codex, you can view a dragon's &oHunger&r and &oHealth&r. If you lack a codex, \", { \"text\": \"you should look here\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"gold\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"79C4EC0B34AFD2E7\" } }, \".\" ]"
				"Hunger is easy to understand, though it should be known that &o&6dragons have a preference for fish&r, though some may also eat other raw meats of common livestock."
				"&oHappiness&r is an attribute that may confuse you at first, but no worries. While feeding your dragon also increases its happiness, &6&oa much more efficient way is to brush them.&r Doing so is a simple matter, all you need is to right click your dragon. If you'd like, you can even hold right click for faster brushing."
			]
			id: "7C8E3507744264CE"
			rewards: [{
				amount: 100L
				currency: "eternalcurrencies:ancientcoins"
				id: "4D9E1FE4C3573F0D"
				ignore_reward_blocking: true
				type: "eternalcurrencies:currency"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "5F444373FCC99446"
				item: {
