			title: "How To Care For a Dragon"
			x: 1.0d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2CDA1B09CD0AAB77"]
			description: [
				"Dragons are very special creatures. They are not a being you merely befriend and then call on when it's convenient. They have needs. And to see those needs, you'll want a &o&6Draconic Codex&r. Check the next page for a break down on it."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Upon opening it, you'll be met with a blank screen. If you've tamed a dragon already, you should see their entry on the left. Clicking on it, you'll be met with a similar screen to this."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/draconic-codex.png width:170 height:90 align:center}"
				"On the left page, you'll of course see your dragon. Underneath are its various &oattributes&r. &o&6Specifically, you can see its &dHealth,&r&o &7Armor,&r&o &aHunger,&r&o&6 and &eHappiness.&r The two noted at the bottom are its &3&ogender&r and &3&ovariant&r, but we don't need to worry about that right now. The other attributes can be further discussed at a later point."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "79C4EC0B34AFD2E7"
			rewards: [{
				amount: 100L
