		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2CDA1B09CD0AAB77"]
			description: ["While some simple fish may do the trick for dragons, nothing is better for the beasts than a Hearty Dragon Meal. &6&oMade from large and medium sized fish&r, taming dragons can be done with much less bloodshed thanks to these wonderful bundles."]
